# Alhaitham Xingqiu Fischl Ineffa. ~21s Rot. Long field time Alhaitham. Oz is Deployed during Alhaitham's burst window. ~54% Quicken uptime; Alhaitham combo focuses on driving rainswords. Ineffa > Fischl > AlHaitham DPS.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
alhaitham char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
